=Hi William,

The approved posts for {{ $('Build config').first().json.week }} are written and waiting in a draft pull request:
{{ $('GitHub: open pull request').first().json.html_url }}

Review each post (facts, tone, the FAQ section, no coverage advice), edit anything in the GitHub web editor if needed, then mark the PR ready and merge. The site deploys automatically.

Briefs, evidence and post log: {{ $('Build config').first().json.sheetUrl }}

